OL,5,G0030 Through the Night
OL,6,     FCellist Senja Rummukainen joins
OL,7,     Fthe Finnish Radio Symphony
OL,8,     FOrchestra and conductor Andrew
OL,9,     FManze in Elgar's cello concerto.
OL,10,     FThe orchestra also plays music by
OL,11,     FIda Moberg and Brahms.
OL,12,G0630 Breakfast
OL,13,     FHannah French presents Radio 3's
OL,14,     FBreakfast show. To get in touch,
OL,15,     Femail 3breakfast@bbc.co.uk.
OL,16,G0900 Saturday Morning
OL,17,     FTom Service plays the best
OL,18,     Fclassical music alongside the
OL,19,     Flatest stories in the arts world,
OL,20,     Fand meets soprano Angel Blue,
OL,21,     Fpianist Bruce Liu and composer
OL,22,     FJoan Tower.
